# Cease // Desist: the half cast is the only half there is on the stack (CR 709.3), and each half has its own type. Cease is an
# instant, Desist a sorcery (CR 307.5): on Bot2's turn 2, with Bot2's Mox Ruby on the stack and six mana floating in Bot1's pool,
# Bot1 may not cast Desist - the card would be offered only at sorcery timing - but may cast Cease from the very same card in the
# very same window. Cease resolves (Bot1 22 life) and Desist never did: Bot2's Mox Ruby is still on the battlefield.

